      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like that idea. A lot of people are suggesting very valid quality of life options, and i think a main reason devs are thinking twice about adding them is menu space and confusion to players. If we had a seperate well organized menu for Full Body Calibration, that would make it a lot easier",
