  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-02T11:38:58.120Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Everything is crammed into the settings menu. Like with how you get a new button when vrc detects trackers, a new button on the home row could appear with all the fbt settings, and would also make it a bit easier if wanting to add more options/features not having to try to share the same space with comfort and debug as well.",
